{"anomaly_threshold":75,"author":["Elastic"],"description":"机器学习：来自罕见用户上下文的 sudo。对应需求：特权审计 / 异常账号使用。","false_positives":["工程师临时登录排障"],"from":"now-45m","interval":"15m","license":"Elastic License v2","machine_learning_job_id":["v3_linux_rare_sudo_user_ea"],"name":"【默认】Linux异常sudo活动（机器学习）","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用对应数据源（Elastic Defend / System / Windows / auditd，按规则说明）。\n2. 机器学习规则需关联 ML job 成功启动后再评估告警。\n3. 确认相关数据流有数据后再启用。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"1e9fc667-9ff1-4b33-9f40-fefca8537eb0","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: 特权审计"],"type":"machine_learning","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nsudo 活动偏离该主机的用户基线。\n\n### 为何重要\n可能是凭据失陷后提权，也可能是排障。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 确认用户是否应拥有 sudo。\n2. 核对命令与父进程。\n3. 检查前后 SSH 登录源。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"related_integrations":[{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"version":209,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"act